          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu, mndungi ukaja mkate, angu kunywa kikombe cha Bwana kisha, uchakaia na ikosa jeghunonia ishima mumbi ghwa Bwana na bagha yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu ndekuzighane moni kande, ima uje ugho mkate na kunywa kwa kikombe icho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu uo ose ujagha na kunywa usetalagha nicha ghuja mumbi ghwa Bwana, wadaja na kunywa kutanywa kwake moni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihi niyo shekeria ya wandu wengi wenyu kukaia wanyonge na wakongo; na wamu wafue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wei dadakuzighana diweni loli, kumangu ndeditanywagha anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji datanywa ni Bwana, dakabwa; eri disechetanywa andwamweri na wurumwengu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo wanidu, iji mwakwana andwamweri kwa wundu ghwa kuja Ndima ya Bwana, mmbeseriane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngera mundu oko na njala, ndeje nyumbenyi kwake; isechekaia kukwana konyu kumredie kutanywa. Aighu ya agho malagho mazima, nichaghiboisa ingelo nacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
